Startup Board Pro — licence

This product has two parts under two different licences. Which applies depends
on the file.

## 1. Material carried over from Startup Board v1 (MIT)

Startup Board v1 is published at https://github.com/shuvgenai/startup-board
under the MIT licence, and that licence is irrevocable for anything already
published there. Where this product carries v1 material forward — the six fit
stages and their pass conditions, the fit check-in signal logic, the unit
economics edge cases, the warn-then-allow rule, the interview rules, and the
Lean Canvas block definitions — the original MIT notice stands:

