## 2. New material in this edition (proprietary)

Copyright (c) 2026 shuvgenai. All rights reserved.

The following are new to this edition and are not covered by the MIT licence
above:

- the evidence rubric and the scoring of claims 0 to 3
- the conversation contract
- the nine advisor modules in references/advisors/
- the state file, its assumption ledger, and the three loops
- the numeric pass gate on every phase file
- the verdict-to-score table
- the artifact templates in references/artifacts/
- the evaluation suite: check.sh, the rubric, the cases and their criteria

A purchase grants one person the right to use these files, modify them for
their own ventures, and keep using them indefinitely. It does not grant the
right to redistribute, resell, sublicense, or publish them, in whole or in
part, modified or unmodified.

## 3. Honest note on enforcement

These are text files. You can read every line, and nothing here technically
prevents copying. No licence key, no obfuscation and no phone-home code is
included, because none of them would work in a Markdown skill and pretending
otherwise would be dishonest.

The free edition remains free, forever, at the link above.
